      "text": "Which of the following language is accepted by a Turing machine?\n(i) $\\{a^n\\#a^n\\#a^n:n\\geq0\\}$ and $\\Sigma=\\{a,\\#\\}$\n(ii) $\\{a^n\\#b^{2n}:n\\geq0\\}$, $\\Sigma=\\{a,b\\}$",
